Sistema ildizlarini ifodalovchi nuqtalar orasidagi masofani toping ($x > 0$).

$$\left\{ \begin{matrix}
x^{\sqrt{y}} = y, \
y^{\sqrt{y}} = x^{4}
\end{matrix} \right.$$

Tenglamalar sistemasini yeching.

$$\left\{ \begin{matrix}
x^{y + 1} = 27, \
x^{2y - 5} = \frac{1}{3}
\end{matrix} \right.$$

Ushbu

$$\left\{ \begin{matrix}
5^{x} + 5^{- x} = 13, \
28^{x} < 17^{x}
\end{matrix} \right.$$

sistema uchun $5^{x} - 5^{- x}$ ni toping.

mavzular.qoida:
$a > 0$, $a \neq 1$, $x > 0$, $y > 0$ bo'lsin. Logarifmning ta'rifi va asosiy ayniyatlari:
1\. $\log_{a}b = c \Leftrightarrow a^{c} = b$;
2\. $a^{\log_{a}x} = x$;
3\. $\log_{a}a = 1$, $\log_{a}1 = 0$;
4\. $\log_{a}(xy) = \log_{a}x + \log_{a}y$;
5\. $\log_{a}\frac{x}{y} = \log_{a}x - \log_{a}y$;
6\. $\log_{a}x^{p} = p\log_{a}x$;
7\. $\log_{a}x = \frac{\log_{b}x}{\log_{b}a}$;
8\. $\log_{a}b \cdot \log_{b}a = 1$;
9\. $\log_{a}b = \log_{a^{p}}\left( b^{p} \right)$, $p \neq 0$;
10\. $a^{\log_{b}c} = c^{\log_{b}a}$;
11\. $a^{\sqrt{\log_{a}b}} = b^{\sqrt{\log_{b}a}}$.
$y = \log_{a}x$ funksiyaning aniqlanish sohasi $(0; + \infty)$, qiymatlar sohasi $\mathbb{R}$. Uning grafigi $(1;0)$ nuqtadan o'tadi. $a > 1$ bo'lsa funksiya o'suvchi, $0 < a < 1$ bo'lsa kamayuvchi. $\log_{g(x)}f(x)$ ifoda aniqlanishi uchun $f(x) > 0$, $g(x) > 0$ va $g(x) \neq 1$ bo'lishi shart.

